{"unit_id":"linshule__dsh-balance#card-zh","repo":"linshule/dsh-balance","commit":"fab2ea528ee480b3510fa51566f5c59c89710774","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance 是面向 DSH Web 的账户额度监控插件，在侧边栏浮层显示 DeepSeek 账户余额和 OpenCodeGo 计划余量。它通过 Host 路由请求两项服务，并在界面提供可拖动徽章、详情弹层和两个设置页。用户可以查看 DeepSeek 余额明细、OpenCodeGo 近 5 小时/7 天/30 天用量与重置时间，保存或清除对应 Key，并手动刷新或按设定间隔自动刷新。适合需要在 DSH Web 中查看账户余额和计划用量的人；查询 DeepSeek 需配置其 API Key，OpenCodeGo Key 可选填或从 DSH 凭据读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-11","lib/index.js:445-566","lib/client.js:250-360","lib/client.js:607-703"]}
{"unit_id":"linshule__dsh-balance#card-en","repo":"linshule/dsh-balance","commit":"fab2ea528ee480b3510fa51566f5c59c89710774","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-balance is a DSH Web plugin that shows DeepSeek balance and OpenCodeGo usage in a sidebar badge. Users can view details, inspect usage windows and reset times, manage keys, and refresh manually or on a schedule. A DeepSeek API key is needed for balance queries; the OpenCodeGo key is optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-11","lib/index.js:445-566","lib/client.js:250-360","lib/client.js:607-703"]}
